# 🎓 GuruCool

GuruCool is a full-stack mentorship platform designed to connect students and parents with verified mentors for personalized academic and personal development.

The platform focuses on helping students improve not only academically, but also across multiple areas of personal growth through structured mentorship, progress tracking, sessions, and reports.

## 🚀 Key Features

### 👨‍👩‍👧 Parent

- Parent registration and login
- Manage children's profiles
- Track child's overall progress
- View academic and personal development metrics
- Book mentorship sessions
- Manage upcoming sessions
- View mentor profiles
- Receive monthly progress reports

### 🎓 Student

- Personalized student profile
- Track progress across different focus areas
- View mentorship sessions
- Access development reports
- Interact with assigned mentors
- Monitor academic and personal growth

### 👨‍🏫 Mentor

- Mentor registration and authentication
- Mentor profile and expertise management
- Manage availability
- View assigned students
- Manage mentorship sessions
- Track student progress
- Provide feedback and development updates

### 📊 Progress Tracking

GuruCool tracks development across multiple focus areas, allowing parents and students to understand progress over time.

### 📅 Session Management

- Book mentorship sessions
- View upcoming sessions
- Manage scheduled sessions
- Session status tracking
- Mentor availability management

### 🔐 Authentication & Security

- User authentication
- Role-based access
- Protected routes
- Secure password handling
- Backend authorization

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

- React.js
- JavaScript
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router
- Lucide React
- Vite

### Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- JavaScript
- REST API
- JWT Authentication
- Middleware-based authorization

### Database

- MongoDB
- Mongoose

### Development Tools

- Git
- GitHub
- VS Code
- Postman
- npm

