## 🔄 Application Flow

```text
Parent / Student / Mentor
          ↓
       React UI
          ↓
     REST API
          ↓
      Express.js
          ↓
     Controllers
          ↓
      Services
          ↓
      Mongoose
          ↓
       MongoDB
```

## 🎯 Project Goal

The goal of GuruCool is to create a structured digital mentorship ecosystem where students can receive personalized guidance while parents can understand and track their child's academic and personal development.

GuruCool aims to bring mentorship, progress tracking, session management, and communication into a single platform.

## 📌 Current Status

🚧 The project is currently under active development.

The frontend foundation and core UI components have been implemented. Backend APIs, authentication, database integration, and production-level features will be progressively integrated.

## 👨‍💻 Development

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

Install frontend dependencies:

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
```

Run frontend:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Backend setup and database configuration will be added as the backend development progresses.

## 🔒 Environment Variables

Sensitive credentials should be stored in `.env` files and should never be committed to GitHub.

Example:

```env
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
```

